<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Cpromote</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cpromote &lt;member&gt; &lt;rank&gt;
</pre>
<p>Example:
</p>
<pre>cpromote fizban 12
cpromote fizban 0
</pre>
<p>Sets the clan rank of a member of your clan, a number from 1 to 25 (see 
<a cmd='#'>Help Csrank</a> for the titles of your clan's ranks). Rank 0 takes their rank 
away. The member must be in the game.
</p><p>The clan Master and the clan lords can use cpromote, and so can members of 
rank 16 or higher. Without being Master or lord, you can only set ranks below 
your own, and only for members below you. Only the Master can give rank 25, and 
a rank must have a title before anyone can be given it.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Csrank</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Crank</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Cdepose</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Clan Commands</a>
</pre>




</div>